Subject: Cantor SJS Compiled Lookahead Stitch Capacity Revision 0.2 Justification

@ [justification_uuid] 42948fdf-6666-4331-9a68-5fc1d9f81179

& [Decision]
  + widen parent maximum from two to eight and supersede unimplemented sixteen proposal

& [Why]
  + eight is published selector maximum and measured byte-feasible

& [Rejected]
  + sixteen because it confuses pool with selection and its active boundary is impossible under 8192
  + split packets or weaken fixture because either breaks exact correspondence
  + raise byte bound because the reachable selector surface needs no such expansion
